ACE Omni (Cloudflare-native) — provenance of modifications

Original work
-------------

This repository is derived from the publicly released ACE Omni research platform:
https://github.com/mitrefccace/ace-omni

The original government, contract, copyright, and public-release notice is
preserved verbatim in LICENSE. It identifies Contract Number 75FCMC18D0047,
FAR 52.227-14, and public-release identifier 24-0463.

Later modifications
-------------------

The Cloudflare-native rewrite began on 2026-08-05. Its changes are attributed
by this repository's Git history to Robert McConnell, the repository owner and
maintainer. They include a React/Vite web application, a Hono API on Cloudflare
Workers, D1 relational state, per-call Durable Objects, R2 evidence storage,
shared versioned schemas, deterministic scheduling and media manipulation,
security controls, automated tests, and project documentation.

The reliable room transport and semantic-token work added on 2026-08-06
independently adapts maintainer-authored implementation patterns from the
SF26 repository at commit 8b40b449953760e6496f781490329fac41b59633. The
adaptation transfers reconnect, idempotency, token-governance, and contrast
discipline only. It does not use SF26 names, slogans, marks, or visual assets.

